1
00:00:23,616 --> 00:00:28,355
♪Looking in the mirror,
my temples have turned white♪

2
00:00:28,355 --> 00:00:32,067
♪Taking off the hairpins and makeup,
shedding the disguise♪

3
00:00:32,291 --> 00:00:34,536
♪A cold face♪

4
00:00:34,883 --> 00:00:37,590
♪With two lines of tears♪

5
00:00:38,469 --> 00:00:42,997
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

6
00:00:42,997 --> 00:00:46,629
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

7
00:00:47,107 --> 00:00:50,595
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

8
00:00:52,739 --> 00:00:55,235
♪The storyteller says♪

9
00:00:55,235 --> 00:00:59,875
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

10
00:01:00,263 --> 00:01:01,923
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

11
00:01:01,923 --> 00:01:07,875
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

12
00:01:08,067 --> 00:01:11,755
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

13
00:01:12,000 --> 00:01:15,326
♪Don't make me ridiculous♪

14
00:01:15,491 --> 00:01:22,435
♪Some vows turn into smoke
and fade away♪

15
00:01:22,883 --> 00:01:26,504
♪Even the leaves know when autumn comes,
but you don't even know me♪

16
00:01:26,656 --> 00:01:30,188
♪Imprisoned in plight,
yet still full of passion♪

17
00:01:30,496 --> 00:01:35,203
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

18
00:01:35,203 --> 00:01:39,363
♪How can I bear to let go♪

19
00:01:43,328 --> 00:01:46,659
=Whispers of Southern Song=

20
00:01:47,424 --> 00:01:49,859
=Episode 6=

21
00:02:04,192 --> 00:02:05,280
You're awake?

22
00:02:06,920 --> 00:02:08,000
Where are you going?

23
00:02:08,759 --> 00:02:09,560
I...

24
00:02:11,360 --> 00:02:12,599
Are you okay?

25
00:02:12,736 --> 00:02:14,439
Are you going to see Rong Xiaonan?

26
00:02:14,976 --> 00:02:17,360
Mr. Rong learned too much today.

27
00:02:17,800 --> 00:02:18,879
He was agitated.

28
00:02:19,080 --> 00:02:19,879
I...

29
00:02:20,960 --> 00:02:22,240
I need to comfort him.

30
00:02:23,712 --> 00:02:27,680
I took a bullet for you,
so how would you comfort me?

31
00:02:28,280 --> 00:02:30,759
You got hurt saving me, Young Marshal.

32
00:02:31,879 --> 00:02:36,159
I will remember this kindness
and repay it.

33
00:02:40,360 --> 00:02:41,439
How will you repay me?

34
00:02:41,960 --> 00:02:45,159
Judging by your condition,
Young Marshal, you're fine anyway.

35
00:02:54,039 --> 00:02:54,840
Don't move.

36
00:03:18,719 --> 00:03:19,520
Young Marshal!

37
00:03:25,039 --> 00:03:26,479
It better be important.

38
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:29,719
The Governor wants to see you.

39
00:03:38,336 --> 00:03:40,032
(Loyalty)

40
00:03:41,760 --> 00:03:44,755
(Loyalty)

41
00:03:45,759 --> 00:03:48,879
This character "loyalty"
seems to be missing a dot.

42
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:59,800
Without that dot,
it's no longer the character "loyalty".

43
00:04:08,320 --> 00:04:09,408
(Loyalty)

44
00:04:10,720 --> 00:04:15,240
You only taught me how
to hold a gun, not how to hold a pen.

45
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:29,279
You botched the Buddha Head case
and killed Xiaosheng Society's envoy.

46
00:04:29,952 --> 00:04:33,040
Now you've killed Adjutant Zhao as well.

47
00:04:33,319 --> 00:04:38,600
You! You're out of control!

48
00:04:39,072 --> 00:04:45,279
Today, I'll teach you
how to write this character "loyalty".

49
00:04:47,560 --> 00:04:52,759
Do you want a loyal fool
who's useless, or a gun that works?

50
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:58,360
Only I can help you
retrieve the Jade Buddha Head.

51
00:05:00,279 --> 00:05:05,279
(Need him to find Buddha Head and trade
for Phoenix Crown. Can't kill him yet.)

52
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:12,439
You're quite like me.

53
00:05:13,040 --> 00:05:13,839
How is it?

54
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:18,959
Having your life in someone else's hands
isn't pleasant, right?

55
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:22,976
So, do you want
to sit in the Governor's seat?

56
00:05:22,976 --> 00:05:23,920
Yes!

57
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:24,639
Good!

58
00:05:26,368 --> 00:05:29,439
I'll give you one last chance.

59
00:05:30,040 --> 00:05:33,759
Find the Buddha Head
for me within five days,

60
00:05:34,048 --> 00:05:38,160
and I'll give you the Governor's seat.

61
00:05:39,136 --> 00:05:41,600
You get along well with Jiang Chun'er.

62
00:05:42,400 --> 00:05:46,079
Your wedding is in five days.

63
00:05:46,816 --> 00:05:52,992
If you find the Buddha Head for me,
she will be your wife.

64
00:05:54,400 --> 00:05:56,079
But if you fail,

65
00:05:58,279 --> 00:06:04,160
she can still be my wife.

66
00:06:08,439 --> 00:06:10,040
Young Marshal, are you okay?

67
00:06:14,304 --> 00:06:16,560
Go count our men.

68
00:06:17,959 --> 00:06:24,704
Whether for power or for our lives,
we need to have a backup plan.

69
00:06:26,639 --> 00:06:27,439
Yes.

70
00:06:32,079 --> 00:06:32,920
Mr. Rong.

71
00:06:34,464 --> 00:06:35,480
Rong...

72
00:06:57,888 --> 00:06:58,879
Miss Jiang.

73
00:07:01,280 --> 00:07:02,279
Mr. Rong.

74
00:07:02,528 --> 00:07:05,160
I saw you were sleeping deeply,
so I didn't wake you.

75
00:07:05,984 --> 00:07:07,360
Are you okay?

76
00:07:08,032 --> 00:07:09,248
Miss Jiang, don't worry.

77
00:07:10,336 --> 00:07:12,480
I was just overly worried.

78
00:07:15,648 --> 00:07:16,680
Thank you.

79
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:22,040
Before, I only saw you
as just another face in the audience.

80
00:07:23,264 --> 00:07:26,720
These days, I've finally understood.

81
00:07:27,319 --> 00:07:31,160
There is no one else in this world
who treats me as well as you do.

82
00:07:33,079 --> 00:07:36,480
In the future,
if you ever need anything,

83
00:07:37,184 --> 00:07:41,519
even if I have to walk through fire
and tread on blades, I'll get it done.

84
00:07:44,352 --> 00:07:46,360
Mr. Rong, you're too polite.

85
00:07:47,872 --> 00:07:50,040
I really don't want anything in return.

86
00:07:52,512 --> 00:07:53,920
Young Marshal, what is this?

87
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:56,959
I was injured for Miss Jiang.

88
00:07:57,184 --> 00:07:59,360
Miss Jiang ought to repay me
by taking care of me.

89
00:07:59,439 --> 00:08:04,560
Since you also want to take care of
Mr. Rong, why don't I stay with him,

90
00:08:04,992 --> 00:08:07,720
so you won't be stretched too thin?

91
00:08:08,319 --> 00:08:10,079
I can also keep Mr. Rong company.

92
00:08:13,664 --> 00:08:16,480
If you want to stay here, I'll let you.

93
00:08:16,480 --> 00:08:17,399
Let me?

94
00:08:18,176 --> 00:08:21,480
In this Governor Mansion,
do I need your permission to stay here?

95
00:08:25,728 --> 00:08:27,439
If I hadn't helped you escape,

96
00:08:28,000 --> 00:08:31,680
I'm afraid you'd still be rotting
in that dungeon, Young Marshal.

97
00:08:36,080 --> 00:08:37,480
Don't you see it?

98
00:08:38,039 --> 00:08:41,559
You walk free in Governor Mansion now.
And who do you have to thank?

99
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:42,399
Enough!

100
00:08:42,600 --> 00:08:44,279
I see you both are fine.

101
00:08:45,120 --> 00:08:46,519
Take care of yourselves.

102
00:08:53,519 --> 00:08:56,440
So, what brings you here?

103
00:08:57,480 --> 00:09:01,559
I just came to remind you, Mr. Rong,
don't forget the Jade Buddha Head.

104
00:09:06,848 --> 00:09:08,320
Young Marshal, you said before,

105
00:09:09,159 --> 00:09:12,759
that if you help me find who killed
my master, you'll get the revenge.

106
00:09:16,720 --> 00:09:19,080
The murderer is Xu Fan.

107
00:09:19,584 --> 00:09:22,120
Once you keep your word
and take his life,

108
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:24,720
I will naturally help you
retrieve the Jade Buddha Head.

109
00:09:24,720 --> 00:09:26,039
What evidence do you have?

110
00:09:26,039 --> 00:09:29,720
I can see the blood debts
soaked into things.

111
00:09:30,440 --> 00:09:36,080
That day, I touched the fake one,
and saw the saber go into Master's chest.

112
00:09:36,600 --> 00:09:38,759
But I still couldn't see
the murderer's face.

113
00:09:39,039 --> 00:09:41,919
Until yesterday, when I touched
Adjutant Zhao's sidearm,

114
00:09:42,480 --> 00:09:46,816
I finally confirmed
the murderer is Xu Fan.

115
00:09:48,768 --> 00:09:52,080
Just based on
your superstitious nonsense,

116
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:56,559
you want me to raise my sword
against the man who raised me?

117
00:09:56,559 --> 00:09:58,080
I don't need you to believe me.

118
00:09:59,168 --> 00:10:04,879
If you break your word, you won't
find the Jade Buddha Head through me.

119
00:10:07,240 --> 00:10:11,320
And I will kill Xu Fan
with my own hands.

120
00:10:17,280 --> 00:10:20,080
You want to assassinate
the Governor in his mansion?

121
00:10:20,919 --> 00:10:23,960
Don't you see
what your situation is right now?

122
00:10:24,448 --> 00:10:29,720
Even if you fight like a trapped beast,
you should weigh your own strength.

123
00:10:40,120 --> 00:10:40,919
Mr. Rong.

124
00:10:41,568 --> 00:10:42,480
Miss Jiang.

125
00:10:42,799 --> 00:10:43,600
What's wrong?

126
00:10:44,480 --> 00:10:50,759
After Adjutant Zhao captured Yue Niang,
the child was killed.

127
00:10:53,216 --> 00:10:54,240
Mr. Rong.

128
00:10:55,392 --> 00:10:56,639
Are you okay?

129
00:11:00,039 --> 00:11:00,879
I'm fine.

130
00:11:03,040 --> 00:11:04,639
Miss Jiang, please rest assured.

131
00:11:06,880 --> 00:11:12,120
This "Tale of Vindication" hasn't
reached the dragon-slaying yet.

132
00:11:13,056 --> 00:11:15,296
(Governor Mansion)

133
00:11:32,768 --> 00:11:33,472
Stop!

134
00:11:57,399 --> 00:11:58,048
This way!

135
00:11:58,048 --> 00:11:58,679
- Yes.
- Yes.

136
00:12:56,720 --> 00:12:57,519
Young Marshal.

137
00:12:57,639 --> 00:12:59,519
Someone attempted to assassinate
the Governor.

138
00:12:59,559 --> 00:13:00,720
We are ordered to search.

139
00:13:05,344 --> 00:13:07,120
You actually dared to make a move?

140
00:13:07,456 --> 00:13:13,879
In this situation,
should I call you brave or stupid?

141
00:13:14,399 --> 00:13:15,200
Young Marshal.

142
00:13:17,799 --> 00:13:18,600
Young Marshal.

143
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:20,320
Are you okay? Young Marshal.

144
00:13:21,088 --> 00:13:23,232
Mr. Rong, are you willing
to cooperate with me now?

145
00:13:23,232 --> 00:13:25,696
- We're coming in!
- One more chance.

146
00:13:25,696 --> 00:13:27,000
Are you okay, Young Marshal?

147
00:13:27,000 --> 00:13:30,120
Do you want to live or die?

148
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:33,679
- You think I'll still trust you?
- Young Marshal.

149
00:13:33,888 --> 00:13:35,712
Then go die, Mr. Rong.

150
00:13:37,888 --> 00:13:39,104
Are you okay, Young Marshal?

151
00:13:41,184 --> 00:13:42,000
Governor.

152
00:13:43,968 --> 00:13:44,919
Break it open!

153
00:13:51,200 --> 00:13:51,904
Foster Father.

154
00:13:52,192 --> 00:13:53,568
What brings you here personally?

155
00:13:53,919 --> 00:13:56,080
Someone tried
to assassinate me just now.

156
00:13:57,320 --> 00:13:59,399
I wounded him and he fled.

157
00:13:59,960 --> 00:14:01,879
Did you notice anything unusual?

158
00:14:03,879 --> 00:14:04,679
No.

159
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:09,799
Search.

160
00:14:11,136 --> 00:14:12,240
Search thoroughly.

161
00:14:16,224 --> 00:14:17,200
Check over there.

162
00:14:20,480 --> 00:14:21,840
Open that one.

163
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:28,639
Check carefully.

164
00:14:29,039 --> 00:14:30,919
Even search the bathtub.

165
00:14:33,200 --> 00:14:34,000
Insolent!

166
00:14:49,519 --> 00:14:53,799
Xu You'an, negligent in duty
and in violation of military code,

167
00:14:54,559 --> 00:14:56,080
shall receive fifty lashes

168
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:58,399
as a warning to all.

169
00:15:32,640 --> 00:15:37,168
♪If an actor could gain pity♪

170
00:15:37,344 --> 00:15:40,800
♪The audience offers sincere words♪

171
00:15:41,278 --> 00:15:44,766
♪Perhaps the story could be changed♪

172
00:15:46,910 --> 00:15:49,406
♪The storyteller says♪

173
00:15:49,406 --> 00:15:54,046
♪This mortal world is full of turmoil♪

174
00:15:54,434 --> 00:15:56,094
♪Within sight but beyond reach♪

175
00:15:56,094 --> 00:16:02,046
♪Yet I still don't want to give up♪

176
00:16:02,238 --> 00:16:05,926
♪Don't let the memory be hollowed out♪

177
00:16:07,039 --> 00:16:08,519
Take care, Foster Father.

178
00:16:09,664 --> 00:16:14,368
♪I mock this absurd and entangled love♪

179
00:16:14,688 --> 00:16:18,464
♪How can I bear to let go♪

180
00:16:39,008 --> 00:16:40,288
♪As if it were fate♪

181
00:16:40,288 --> 00:16:41,645
♪Deliberately playing tricks♪

182
00:16:42,207 --> 00:16:45,444
♪We miss each other♪

183
00:16:46,688 --> 00:16:48,256
♪Creating a turbulent drama♪

184
00:16:48,256 --> 00:16:50,656
♪And a bizarre♪

185
00:16:50,656 --> 00:16:53,458
♪Anonymous legend♪

186
00:16:53,988 --> 00:16:56,000
♪The plot twists and turns♪

187
00:16:56,148 --> 00:16:57,888
♪Play out over and over again♪

188
00:16:57,888 --> 00:17:00,952
♪Waiting to be discarded♪

189
00:17:01,184 --> 00:17:03,232
♪And you are like a moth to the flame♪

190
00:17:03,232 --> 00:17:04,224
♪Refuse to submit♪

191
00:17:04,224 --> 00:17:07,424
♪I can't bear to blame you♪

192
00:17:08,960 --> 00:17:12,000
♪There are always too many♪

193
00:17:12,000 --> 00:17:13,888
♪Helpless situations♪

194
00:17:13,888 --> 00:17:16,512
♪Overwhelmed by time♪

195
00:17:17,643 --> 00:17:19,603
♪Even if I have questions♪

196
00:17:19,603 --> 00:17:21,603
♪I harbor desires♪

197
00:17:21,603 --> 00:17:24,480
♪Nowhere to find answers♪

198
00:17:24,831 --> 00:17:26,464
♪People come and go♪

199
00:17:26,464 --> 00:17:29,280
♪I'm still all alone♪

200
00:17:29,280 --> 00:17:32,008
♪Wandering around♪

201
00:17:32,256 --> 00:17:35,109
♪Fortunate to have you with me♪

202
00:17:35,109 --> 00:17:39,570
♪Go through the entanglement♪

203
00:17:39,936 --> 00:17:41,664
♪If longing♪

204
00:17:41,664 --> 00:17:44,823
♪Turns into dust and smoke♪

205
00:17:44,823 --> 00:17:47,578
♪How can I be at ease♪

206
00:17:47,680 --> 00:17:49,994
♪Having walked through prosperous times♪

207
00:17:50,112 --> 00:17:51,968
♪And travelled around the world♪

208
00:17:52,064 --> 00:17:55,152
♪Scars all over me♪

209
00:17:55,424 --> 00:17:58,336
♪If longing never fades♪

210
00:17:58,336 --> 00:17:59,785
♪Burns still hot♪

211
00:17:59,785 --> 00:18:02,864
♪Let it turn into dust and smoke♪

212
00:18:03,136 --> 00:18:04,993
♪After half a lifetime of loneliness♪

213
00:18:05,056 --> 00:18:06,240
♪In the next life♪

214
00:18:06,240 --> 00:18:10,720
♪Entangle with you again♪
